-- Phase H1: taxonomy seed (29 level 1, 71 level 2). Generated by scripts/generate-taxonomy-seed.mjs from
-- docs/taxonomy.json; regenerate rather than edit by hand. Each category gets one dictionary event, level 1
-- first, so dictionary-changes?since=0 hands clients the whole taxonomy in order.

